      "id": "2117690602318094557",
      "text": "Just saw YOU CAN SEE EVERYTHING by @A24 and it blew my mind. I'll probably watch again this week. The number of WTF moments is staggering (e.g., “Whoa, a cock in a shower! ... Holy shit, why is an infant just standing on a table behind them? ... Abbott and Costello?!”\n\nIt also inspired the fuck out of me. Editing that film almost certainly took 10 years off of the lives of @nathanfielder, @lanceopp, and team. If they’d gone 80%, it would have been terrible. Instead, they went 100%, and it’s a masterpiece. I've seen all sorts of buzz online around their \"marketing playbook,\" but here's their marketing secret: make the product so ridiculously good and unique that people can't stop talking about it.\n\n\"Where am I 3/4-assing?\" is the question haunting me this week. What a gift.",
